{"v":4,"catch":"在“Nekketsu”系列的第二個作品中扮演Kunio-kun躲避球！","desc":"“Super Dodge Ball”是由Technos Japan於1987年發行的動作遊戲。\n玩家與世界各地的強大球隊競爭，成為世界上的超級道奇球團。\n在日本，這是第二部由Technos Japan電子遊戲角色“ Kunio-kun”主演的遊戲。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-08-27","genres":["動作","街機","運動"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0c411e1063463511ee42c1c415028b3c5ed11d80221ca4a447bb7dc790d2508a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5f788af5ca3081c4edc106110c0aa85ea98c63531b8b9f58cec3de98ccd5e4ef.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/00a8cfd0fbc622c557bdcff8667b60ab9bf8d7e7b7b79a83ef79faefe32febff.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/63d51c56576240e6f2b85f5f34432b2367e464ad9249850f8a980eee8b4b01f6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7604d680910e2ff7c2c77feb356eed3783c9e4305c197a865a38704452aed3a1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fed895eb04c269888d05f65dd56d02b345bde299695f4efaa27595ec415ca48c.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c6c009812000","dlc":[]}